{"layout":"timeline","root":{"data":{"text":"<p>发展历程</p>","expand":true,"uid":"292dba24-7483-4d55-938a-0109c8afd850","richText":true,"isActive":false,"imgMap":{},"freeNodeTrees":[]},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>固定的管线，部分可配置</p>","uid":"18508482-c265-474e-bf95-297eab5ec03c","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>GPU:高延迟，高吞吐</p>","uid":"e77994b6-73c7-45d0-a476-554a13d6820e","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>英伟达的geForce256</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"aeb5a45c-1e9a-4210-8080-9c5ab0b318b6"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>主要负责二维图形、帧缓冲和显示输出</p>","uid":"9d55abea-a3be-4aac-b306-dc967887150a","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>部分阶段可编程</p>","generalization":[],"uid":"4f59a2ee-f942-4a84-9ed3-2461d0bc6fa3","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>可编程顶点：GeForce3</p>","uid":"cd382e22-a643-42a9-a8e2-a04b4cb67de5","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>顶点处理器与像素处理器是分开</p>","uid":"3378a777-1b7b-4b9e-9749-df61b9d4ff42","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>统一着色器架构</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"dee18b54-e7d9-446b-9ff5-e4842426a941"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>SIMT，使用同一个着色器程序的被分为一个组，叫wrap</p>","uid":"ce5ae979-6f25-458a-a1af-8bc28bd21243","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>通过切换来保持gpu忙碌</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"17cf0d0e-166e-4ad6-a874-a8879686347b"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>着色器程序结构 和 动态分支都会影响gpu 效率</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"1d523efd-d5f9-4024-a9d2-ef9bd35ddafc"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>现代GPU使用的是通用着色器核心</p>","uid":"2ed28b0c-63c3-43a4-ab09-fee9dfeabaec","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>SM 包含计算核心（CUDA Core）、Warp 调度器、寄存器文件和共享内存</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"07b56f8e-ad3f-45d6-9e39-de4c9154d76c"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>更多可编程能力</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"e613dea4-4c8e-489d-bffb-2d4b3f4cc106"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>计算术单元增多，只增加“核心数”已不能保证更快。开始提升带宽，缓存容量，数据压缩</p>","uid":"f7ed79f0-0318-4c97-948d-9d5ba5799c28","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>DirecrtX11</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"b1c0c803-ee33-4a32-a2e7-89ef8fc3bbcc"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>引入来UAV(无序访问视图）</p>","uid":"b33fe104-86bd-4f03-a049-b1d0b2dda1a3","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>曲面细分和计算着色器</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"7f0ee397-ca87-426e-8475-978bfb51901d"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>DirectX12,Vulkan</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"0a7551f0-0d67-4eb3-a324-b26c8269fef1"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>跨平台，兼容性强。管理命令提交、资源及同步，将更多原本是驱动处理的内容交给应用</p>","uid":"2f26df6e-5f6a-435b-9587-f60e3c0550c5","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>微软：DirectX12</p>","uid":"d5d9e061-e1a5-409a-ac8c-01c2db28d7f3","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>科纳斯：OpenGL,Vulkan</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"80eded45-f5f7-4bee-8fd7-1f88642e20ba"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>苹果：Metal</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"6d2bd189-d2ca-406d-8726-6a63d3402639"},"children":[]}]}]}]},"theme":{"template":"code","config":{}},"view":{"transform":{"scaleX":0.8,"scaleY":0.8000000000000002,"shear":0,"rotate":0,"translateX":-762.8666666666684,"translateY":12.599999999999284,"originX":0,"originY":0,"a":0.8,"b":0,"c":0,"d":0.8,"e":-762.8666666666684,"f":12.599999999999284},"state":{"scale":0.8,"x":-762.8666666666684,"y":12.599999999999284,"sx":-545.8666666666684,"sy":86.59999999999928}}}